na persona lo approccia. Egli custodisce un enorme segreto, qualcosa che non può rivelare davvero a nessuno... Un giorno viene avvicinato da una misteriosa ragazza..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Big Order","overview":"Ten years ago, a child wished for the destruction of the world. Now, a group of people has the ability to grant their wishes depending on their power. They are called \"Order User.\" Before these great people who have the power of \"Order,\" one person excels the most with the ability to rule and conquer the world and turn people into puppets when it is in his jurisdiction. This power belongs to Hoshimiya Eiji, who is also responsible for the destructive phenomena that happened exactly ten years ago."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"ビッグオーダー","overview":"物語の主人公、星宮エイジの通う高校に転校生がやって来た。容姿端麗なその彼女は、紅鈴(くれないりん)という。お近づきになりたい、と願うエイジ。下校して帰宅の途に着くエイジの背後に現れたのは、何とその転校生、紅鈴だった！？","tagline":"これは、世界の滅亡から始まる物語。 星宮エイジが太宰府政庁十人衆を率いて、世界侵略を目指すバトルストーリー。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AjF71yoEIWgVxdf5vpoyJs9Vz1b.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AjF71yoEIWgVxdf5vpoyJs9Vz1b.png","language":"ja","width":788,"height":161},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3JIZXLnGXBurREe9zLzu3DUVMex.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3JIZXLnGXBurREe9zLzu3DUVMex.png","language":"ja","width":4319,"height":705},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5FPqVMCwwhj9sefxlsBQHIMQTpG.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5FPqVMCwwhj9sefxlsBQHIMQTpG.png","language":"ja","width":4301,"height":634}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n5jDsiekbTmfk8ZwxEOFGPUJzek.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n5jDsiekbTmfk8ZwxEOFGPUJzek.jpg","language":"en","width":638,"height":957},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q5EkN2qWh5WBY44gmDYu2PV0aVt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q5EkN2qWh5WBY44gmDY